34,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The staffing rolls show a shortage of trained phenotyping technicians, but an increase in applicants for modelling and code posts.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,1,talk,Midori,,"The travel and bench-fee lines show frozen vehicle-hire and per-diem lines, but increased shipping charges.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The accreditation and bookings show the animal facility has gained resident veterinary cover, but glasshouse blocks are fully booked.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The portfolio review shows awards built on live breeding colonies overran schedule more often than those focused on computation.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The closeout files show catalogue-style awards still drawing outside users a decade on, while mechanism-focused ones ended unresolved.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Midori, do you think the increased shipping charges will affect the projects significantly?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, it might, especially for projects that require a lot of material transport.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"The minutes on secondments show senior modelling analysts are seconded abroad until next autumn, but the glasshouse crew is at full strength.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, that's good to know. It will help us understand the current capacity for different types of projects.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, do you think the full strength of the glasshouse crew will be beneficial for plant-related projects?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Midori,,The station records show three of the five partner field sites lost a whole season to flooding or fire.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, yes, it will ensure that plant-related projects can proceed without delays.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, that's concerning. It might affect the data collection for field-based projects.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Servas,,I think we have a good understanding of the current state. Let's move on to the next round.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
